 "arrive_text": "Gergovia's plateau stands over the valley like a table set for giants, its wall a dark stripe along the top. Below the wall the lower town has spilled down the slope: houses on their plots, a market hall, smoke from a hundred fires, and on the open ground by the road a camp of men with new spears and old cloaks. Everyone is shouting. Nobody seems to be in charge, and everyone says the king is.",
